1
00:00:00,613 --> 00:00:02,903
(Sheldon:)I'm not asking for me.

2
00:00:03,074 --> 00:00:05,574
(Sheldon:)I'm asking for Hawking.

3
00:00:06,703 --> 00:00:10,123
Let me try gangster: Hells no.

4
00:00:13,793 --> 00:00:15,373
(Sheldon:)Okay, look. How about this?

5
00:00:15,545 --> 00:00:18,135
You just give him my paper
on the Higgs boson.

6
00:00:18,298 --> 00:00:21,258
If he sees the breakthrough l've made,
he'll reach out to me.

7
00:00:21,426 --> 00:00:24,056
- What if he doesn't?
- Yeah, he will. He's really smart.

8
00:00:26,681 --> 00:00:28,511
(Howard:)That's an interesting idea.

9
00:00:28,683 --> 00:00:31,723
(Howard:)Why don't you give me a minute
to talk it over with my friends?

10
00:00:31,895 --> 00:00:33,025
- How?
- Walk away.

11
00:00:33,188 --> 00:00:34,818
Walking away!

12
00:00:43,573 --> 00:00:46,663
(Leonard:)You do realize
you own his ass right now.

13
00:00:46,826 --> 00:00:48,786
(Raj:)l do.

14
00:00:48,953 --> 00:00:50,833
(Raj:)You can make him
do anything you want.

15
00:00:50,997 --> 00:00:54,627
(Howard:)Yeah, I know. I'm just trying to figure out
how much I wanna punish him.

16
00:00:54,793 --> 00:00:56,003
(Raj:)Well, don't be too mean.

17
00:00:56,169 --> 00:00:57,959
Hey, I'm thinking about making...

18
00:00:58,129 --> 00:01:00,629
(Sheldon:)...freshly brewed iced tea
if anyone would like some.

